msgstr ""

#: ../../../internals/ethdebug_internal_debug_info.rst:211
msgid ""
"The value has no region because the program recomputes it where it is used. "
"The format carries no recovery recipe, so a debugger reports the value as "
"unavailable; the phase records that recomputation would be possible in "
"principle, unlike ``optimized-out``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../internals/ethdebug_internal_debug_info.rst:213
msgid "``optimized-out``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../internals/ethdebug_internal_debug_info.rst:214
