#: ../../../internals/ethdebug_internal_debug_info.rst:320
msgid "``Remap``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../internals/ethdebug_internal_debug_info.rst:321
msgid ""
"Rewrite the pointer when the pass renames or physically moves a materialized "
"value. Renaming passes rewrite the Yul names a pointer reads; because a "
"statically addressed pointer holds no Yul name, renaming cannot affect it. "
"Spilling passes move where the value is found, so the pointer changes from a "
"stack to a memory region; the data itself is not relocated by the debug info."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../internals/ethdebug_internal_debug_info.rst:324
msgid ""
"``Disambiguator``, ``NameSimplifier``, ``VarNameCleaner``, ``SSATransform``, "
"``SSAReverser``, ``ExpressionSplitter``, ``LoopInvariantCodeMotion``, "
"``StackToMemoryMover``, ``StackCompressor``, ``StackLimitEvader``"
